  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/klxHUoL.png\" alt=\"横幅\" width=\"1280\" height=\"100\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gKjDfS5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"424\"></span>\n</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/4J2ZM6T8nT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/950771581787983912?label=&amp;color=518bcc&amp;labelColor=1f5899&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;logoColor=ffffff\" width=\"136\" height=\"28\"> </a></p><p><a href=\"https://twitter.com/LodestarMC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ -推特-5800ff?style=for-the-badge&amp;color=518bcc&amp;labelColor=1f5899&amp;logo=Twitter\" width=\"110\" height=\"28\"> </a></p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ -支持Forge/Fabric/Quilt-5800ff?style=for-the-badge&amp;color=518bcc&amp;labelColor=1f5899&amp;logo=CurseForge\" width=\"243\" height=\"28\"><p></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DcMjSrZ.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1280\" height=\"32\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;font-size:24px\">完善的基建永远应该胜过单一终极装备</span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"> </p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Aileron模组旨在调整鞘翅机制，使其与其他交通系统平衡的同时拓展功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我们通过引入新机制和附魔——主要面向多人游戏设计，但单人体验同样出色——让鞘翅飞行更有趣且平衡。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若您不认同某些设计，别担心！所有设定都可调整。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">设计理念很明确：Minecraft本质是探索游戏，而鞘翅让玩家能以离谱速度无视地形穿梭，这与核心体验背道而驰。这不仅使地形贬值、世界\"变小\"，还导致玩家在基建时因距离无意义而彼此疏离。鞘翅还让其他交通基建形同虚设——精心铺设的铁路网？无用的下界交通枢纽？花大把时间培育的骏马？统统失去意义。解决方案是：让鞘翅需要同等投入，既使其成为更有成就感的升级，又能让玩家复用现有基建。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wh6GVEe.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1280\" height=\"32\"></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>机制改动</strong></span></h3><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>视角倾斜</strong></span></h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">高速飞行急转弯时，玩家视角会产生物理惯性倾斜。</span>  </p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>上升气流</strong></span></h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">装备鞘翅时在营火蹲伏1秒可蓄力垂直弹射，飞越营火时也会获得升力助推。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EIQkVDK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"528\"></span></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>烟花尾迹</strong></span></h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">烟花不再提供速度加成，改为留下炫酷的粒子尾迹（仅视觉效果）。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/afnfYOq.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"528\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>营火堆叠</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">相邻营火数量越多，烟雾柱攀升越高。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2sgEAV7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"762\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/v7izmLi.gif\" width=\"1127\" height=\"28\"></p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>新增附魔</strong></span></h3><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>烟囱推进</strong></span></h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">允许储存最多3次营火助推（每级附魔+1次），飞行时按跳跃键消耗次数爆发加速。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">宝藏附魔。与云际穿梭互斥。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1eNzROW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"528\"></span></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>云际穿梭</strong></span></h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">海拔越高空气阻力越小，突破云层后可实现超长距高速滑翔。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">宝藏附魔。与烟囱推进互斥。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/thlGUrK.png\" width=\"1280\" height=\"600\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"> </p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">与<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elytra-bounce\" rel=\"nofollow\">鞘翅弹跳</a>模组搭配效果更佳，可实现飞行地面反弹。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> </span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Aileron是Lodestar旗下模组，采用LGPLv3协议。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">可自由用于整合包，若能告知我们将不胜感激！</p>",
